# Frontend Rules (TypeScript / React)

## TypeScript Rules
- Strict mode always — type everything, never use `any` (use `unknown` if truly needed)
- Prefer `interface` for public API shapes, `type` for unions/intersections
- Use `as const` for literal types; use `satisfies` for type-checked object literals without widening
- Named functions preferred: `function foo() {}` — not `const foo = () => {}`
- Arrow functions are fine for lambdas: `.map(item => ...)`, inline callbacks

## React Rules
- Functional components with hooks only
- Keep components simple and focused — no business logic inside components
- No global state management — use React hooks + TanStack Query instead
- No inline styles — use Tailwind classes only

## TanStack Stack
- **Router**: File-based routing via `createFileRoute` in `src/routes/`
- **Query**: All API calls go through TanStack Query (`useQuery`, `useMutation`)
- **Form**: Use TanStack Form for complex forms instead of manual state
- **Start**: SPA mode only — never use server functions or any server-side TanStack Start features

## UI & Styling
- Prefer **Shadcn** components for UI elements when available
- Use **Tailwind v4** utility classes for all styling — prefer theme colors (e.g., `bg-primary`) over built-in colors (e.g., `bg-blue-600`)
- Use `cn()` from `@/shared/lib/utils` for conditional class names
- Responsive: use `sm:`, `md:`, `lg:` prefixes as needed

## API Client
- Always use `useApiClient()` hook + TanStack Query — never build HTTP requests manually
- **Never edit** files in `src/shared/clients/` — they are auto-generated
- To regenerate after backend changes: `npx apx-gen` (run from `[Project].Web`)
- The API does not need to be running — the OpenAPI spec is generated at build time (`dotnet build`)

```typescript
// Standard query pattern
const client = useApiClient()
const { data, isLoading, error } = useQuery({
  queryKey: ['resource', id],
  queryFn: async () => {
    const [result] = await client.getResource({ id })
    if (!result) throw new Error('Failed to load')
    return result
  },
})
```

## File Organization
- `src/routes/` — TanStack Router pages (`createFileRoute`)
- `src/shared/clients/` — AUTO-GENERATED, do not edit
- `src/shared/hooks/` — reusable React hooks
- `src/shared/lib/` — pure utility functions
- `src/modules/[feature]/` — group related files when a feature needs 3+ files

## Naming Conventions
- Files: `kebab-case.tsx` (general) or `PascalCase.tsx` (components)
- Components: `PascalCase`
- Functions & variables: `camelCase`
- Constants: `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE` or `camelCase`
- Types/Interfaces: `PascalCase`

## Import Style
- Use `@/` for all absolute imports (e.g., `@/shared/hooks/useApiClient`)
- No barrel exports (`index.ts` re-exports) unless genuinely needed
- No new dependencies without justification
